    - target: {fileID: 353955888, guid: 74b5c6b26f0fc4028b9aac1a7a36767d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: items.Array.data[0].text
      value: I'm the founder of FMWC.  It doesn't look like you have unlocked any
        functions yet?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 353955888, guid: 74b5c6b26f0fc4028b9aac1a7a36767d, type: 3}
      propertyPath: items.Array.data[1].text
      value: Ah!  Well in that case, I will offer you the following 3 free functions,
